{"class":"rejection","derivation":"RFC 7520 Section 4.3 uses ES512 (P-521). RequestSeal.JOSE.JWS.verify/2 requires a policy drawn from the documented eight-name Crypto JWS set: RS256, PS256, PS384, PS512, HS256, ES256, ES384, EdDSA. The policy names ES512, outside that set, so it rejects as jose/input.invalid_policy before signature verification.","evidence_class":"reviewed_derivation","expected":{"rule_id":"jose/input.invalid_policy"},"format":"request-seal-conformance-case/1","id":"jws/rfc7520-4_3.ecdsa_signature","inputs":{"compact":{"b64":""},"key":{"ref":{"file":"sources/rfc7520/4_3.ecdsa_signature.json","pointer":"/input/key"}}},"policy":{"algorithms":["ES512"],"timeout":{"int":"5000"}},"source":{"document":"RFC 7520","section":"4.3","url":"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7520.html#section-4.3"},"surface":"jws.verify"}